{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\[Chronicles Of The Reincarnated Demon God]\nBlacksmith terakhir sekaligus pengrajin ulung yang tersisa di dunia.\n\nTangannya hancur karena kebakaran di bengkel, membuatnya tak bisa lagi menempa.\nNamun, sebuah game realitas virtual bernama Ares pun datang mengetuk pintu Hyun-soo.\n\n\\[Artefak Tak Dapat Diperbaiki.]\n\\[Tidak dapat ditempa karena batasan level.]\n\n“Eh? Tapi aku ini Blacksmith manual, loh.”\nBagi dirinya, batasan sistem sama sekali tak berlaku.\n\nBegitulah dimulainya permainan penuh gejolak sang Blacksmith jenius.","alternative_title":"천재 대장장이의 게임","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"fa5b6062-3cd9-4c40-97c8-dad2d2a4cb69","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"62fd2c7f-49d7-4a53-8f85-3445b4da84ce","number":"64","chapter":"64","title":"","date":"2026-07-25","released":"2026-07-25"},{"chapter_id":"4329efa5-a4b9-489f-baa8-64f93a36f25a","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18"},{"chapter_id":"4f750f50-0d3b-46a3-b2af-31a264c92afe","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11"},{"chapter_id":"9222bf10-15a2-48f0-9757-3ba61e1b1af4","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"b4a90a42-e29d-4643-ace7-2b587224f516","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"3fe61a0b-951c-4ba5-afe2-da870ada5fe6","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-06-20","released":"2026-06-20"},{"chapter_id":"26fc74fa-f143-4bf1-9050-102ba144a434","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"87a08631-2c58-4d05-942f-eed6cd599574","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-06-09","released":"2026-06-09"},{"chapter_id":"fea7f8cd-fe32-4634-bad1-6347fe0396ad","number":"56","chapter":"56","title